OL,3,GNEWSATwo NHS trusts to use
OL,4,Aspeech-to-notes technology
OL,5,
OL,6,FTechnology that listens to patient
OL,7,Fconsultations and generates notes will
OL,8,Fbe rolled out at two NHS trusts, after
OL,9,Fa successful pilot scheme.
OL,11,FThe project at Walsall Healthcare "on
OL,12,Faverage reduced clinicians'
OL,13,Fdocumentation time to less than four
OL,14,Fminutes per patient", The Royal
OL,15,FWolverhampton said.
OL,17,FEquipment listened "securely" and
OL,18,Fautomatically generated "structured
OL,19,Fclinical notes, which are reviewed,
OL,20,Fedited where necessary and approved
OL,21,Fbefore being added to the patient's
OL,22,Frecord", it explained.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
