OL,3,GNEWSATwo NHS trusts to use
OL,4,Aspeech-to-notes technology
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Wolverhampton, which has a
OL,7,Fstrategic partnership with Walsall
OL,8,FHealthcare, said the technology would
OL,9,F"initially be introduced in Emergency
OL,10,FDepartments and outpatient specialties
OL,11,Facross both Trusts, and across all
OL,12,Fareas by 2028".
